/-!
# Logarithmic prerequisites for line-bundle classification

Nowhere-zero entire functions on `ℂ²` have normalized entire logarithms.
The actual logarithms of every holomorphic factor give an integer
two-cocycle and a genuine alternating integral pairing. For canonical
Appell--Humbert factors that pairing is the original integral form.

These are logarithmic prerequisites, not an assertion of arbitrary-bundle
triviality, full Appell--Humbert classification, or a Chern-class comparison.
-/
